OL,5,G2100 The Great Devon & Cornwall Floods
OL,6,     FIn 1952 a flash flood in Lynmouth,
OL,7,     FDevon, caused the death of 34
OL,8,     Fpeople as debris smashed into
OL,9,     Fbuildings. Then exactly 52 years
OL,10,     Flater, an eerily similar event
OL,11,     Fstruck Boscastle in Cornwall.
OL,12,G2230 Piers Morgan Uncensored: The Truth
OL,13,G     Behind 9/11
OL,14,     FIt was the day the world changed
OL,15,     Fforever. Twenty-five years later,
OL,16,     Fthe shockwaves remain. Piers cuts
OL,17,     Fthrough the lies.
